# Wave W17-H (Route 40): harbour rock — a wet harbour rock standing in the lane’s water, dark blue-grey with a foam collar at its waterline, the sea baked in around it (design: surf lanes between harbour rocks). Route 40’s own rock, converted from the shipped rock cells after the trigger census proved no encounter trigger can move.
